@startuml Sequence Diagram - Generate Widget Embed Code

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WidgetEmbedView" as EmbedView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> EmbedView : 1 Open widget embed page
activate EmbedView
EmbedView -> EmbedView : 2 Display embed code options

EmbedView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request embed code
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Generate embed code
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Create embed code
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return embed code
ClerkAuth -> EmbedView : 7 Return embed code
EmbedView -> Admin : 8 Display embed code

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate EmbedView

@enduml
